stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> requested: Student/Guardian creates tuition request
  requested --> accepted: Tutor accepts request
  requested --> declined: Tutor rejects request
  requested --> expired: 48h timeout without response
  
  declined --> [*]
  expired --> [*]

  accepted --> awaiting_payment: Escrow order generated
  awaiting_payment --> confirmed: Payment succeeded & deposited in Escrow
  awaiting_payment --> expired: Payment window expires (24h)

  confirmed --> in_progress: First session begins
  confirmed --> cancelled: Cancelled prior to first session
  
  in_progress --> completed: All scheduled sessions executed & attendance marked
  in_progress --> replacement_requested: Guardian requests replacement within 3 sessions
  in_progress --> disputed: Guardian opens dispute on attendance or quality
  in_progress --> safety_hold: Critical safeguarding alert triggered

  replacement_requested --> confirmed: New matched tutor assigned
  replacement_requested --> cancelled: Replacement rejected by guardian (refund issued)

  disputed --> completed: Dispute settled in tutor favor
  disputed --> cancelled: Dispute resolved with refund to guardian

  safety_hold --> in_progress: Safety report dismissed after review
  safety_hold --> cancelled: Safety violation confirmed & tutor suspended

  completed --> [*]: Funds released to tutor balance
  cancelled --> [*]: Applicable refund calculated & disbursed
